It is Thursday afternoon in the office.
I finish my work on my laptop.
My colleague Jonas comes to my desk.
"Are you going to the gym again today, Maya?" Jonas asks.
I shake my head.
"No, I do not want to go to the gym today," I answer.
Jonas looks at me, surprised.
"What do you want to do then?" he asks.
"I want to play badminton today," I say.
"I really like playing badminton."
"Oh, that is cool," Jonas says.
"Can you play well?" he asks.
"Yes, I have played for a long time," I answer.
I take my sports clothes.
I pack everything into my backpack.
"Have fun playing!" Jonas says.
"Thanks, Jonas!"
"See you tomorrow," I say.
It is half past four.
I leave the office.
I am looking forward to the evening.
